able behaviors*, not an unchangeable female nature. It gives you an even clearer roadmap for what to watch for and how to intervene. You came into this conversation with intuition and experience. Now you've got some research in your corner too, if that psychologist's article is solid. Use it. Tell the team what you know about relational conflict patterns. Make them partners in overcoming it. That's leadership.
